          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "The Board of Directors and Stockholders "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.13373239379085,
          118.32092676767684,
          124.32792937091504,
          10.7518876262626
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "E u ronet Services Inc.:"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.07777777777778,
          151.91438289141422,
          829.5001589052288,
          10.82709311868689
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "We have audited the accompanying consolidated balance sheets of Euronet Services Inc. and subsidiaries as of December 31, 2000 and 1999 and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.93374350490195,
          171.6455940656566,
          830.1911948120915,
          10.827093118686776
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "the related consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive loss, changes in stockholders’ (deficit)/equity, and cash flows for each of the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.00576147875817,
          191.70067676767678,
          829.6795154820263,
          10.82709311868689
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "years in the three-year period ended December 31, 2000. These consolidated financial statements are the responsibility of the Company’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.94546736111111,
          211.75575946969695,
          683.6853990604575,
          10.827080176767709
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "management. Our responsibility is to express an opinion on these consolidated financial statements based on our audits. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.79473206699346,
          251.54078503787878,
          829.6998982434642,
          10.827080176767709
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "We conducted our audits in accordance with generally accepted auditing standards in the United States of America. Those standards re q u i re that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.03593533496732,
          271.5958547979799,
          829.5205299428105,
          10.827093118686776
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "we plan and perf o rm the audit to obtain reasonable assurance about whether the financial statements are free of material misstatement. An audit"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.88520674019608,
          291.65093750000005,
          829.8315404003268,
          10.827080176767709
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "includes examining, on a test basis, evidence supporting the amounts and disclosures in the financial statements. An audit also includes assessing"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.01584232026144,
          311.70600726010105,
          829.7135833333334,
          10.82709311868689
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "the accounting principles used and significant estimates made by management, as well as evaluating the overall financial statement pre s e n t a t i o n ."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.85004187091504,
          331.7610899621212,
          397.2227134395425,
          10.82709311868689
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "We believe that our audits provide a reasonable basis for our opinion. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.83999117647059,
          371.5461543560607,
          829.3619614379086,
          10.827054292929233
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "In our opinion, the consolidated financial statements re f e rred to above present fairly, in all material respects, the financial position of Euro n e t"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.16995073529412,
          391.60123705808087,
          829.5218580882353,
          10.827041351010052
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "S e rvices Inc. and subsidiaries as of December 31, 2000 and 1999, and the results of their operations and their cash flows for each of the years in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          76.0259181372549,
          411.65630681818186,
          804.9468265522876,
          10.827054292929233
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/BKGONC+BauerBodoni-Roman",
          "size": 8.25
        },
        "text": "the three-year period ended December 31, 2000 in conformity with generally accepted accounting principles in the United States of America. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          75.9362172385621,
          475.7033671085859,
          85.60603541666667,
          27.56165467171718
